      "id": "claim_d318c343b59142aaa4d999ae4bff2c09",
      "statement": "Self-hosted Supermemory ships no MCP server, so agent/AGENTS.md plus curl and jq in the image constitute the entire integration interface: ingest through POST /v3/documents, semantic recall through POST /v4/search, and stable facts through POST /v4/profile.",
