    {
      "id": "claim_3cd569649a9240378326c4034aa39ec1",
      "statement": "The engine's API key is printed once by its first boot via docker compose run --rm supermemory, is pasted into .env as SUPERMEMORY_API_KEY, and survives restarts because the auth secret lives in the supermemory named volume.",
